{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moon Garden Optimizer is a puzzle strategy game about generating oxygen for a moon habitat while conserving as much water as you can.\u00a0 With the power of unlimited undo, you can retry until you're satisfied with your own score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of Dominion and other deckbuilders.\u00a0 However, this game has no shuffling, and no RNG.\u00a0 Each round starts with a different set of available plants, and you must formulate a strategy to combine them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >63 plants and tools with distinct effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 hand-picked scenarios, and billions of other possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A robot trained on all the world's knowledge, but who still feels like an impostor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cacti</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphs of cacti</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am a solo hobby developer.\u00a0 This is a tightly-scoped single-screen experience, polished to be endlessly replayable.\u00a0 I created something that I wanted but could not find elsewhere: a crunchy strategy game with unlimited undo.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Keep it Simple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931930/d6fe1ed4223d4c1c02755567fef61358d3b59d22.jpg"},{"name":"Out of Space","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931930/08851b3fb08f4dcb2931309e6df9bc00710d4132.jpg"},{"name":"Save Every Drop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931930/10bcf5d77130f2e3d46f694beadb25910b42581c.jpg"},{"name":"One Big Turn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931930/2002cdff308ac3081ed9754bb2039995c